# Root workspace — not publishable (private: true).
# This file suppresses npm 11 gitignore-fallback warnings
# when running `npm publish --dry-run` in workspace packages.
# Per-package publish control lives in packages/qfai/.npmignore.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - Do NOT run `npm pack` / `npm publish` from the repo root.
# - If you accidentally do so, the generated tarball will be almost empty
#   (because we ignore everything under the root), which is a signal that
#   the working directory is wrong.
# Ignore all files under the root workspace; publishing is controlled per package.
**/*
